    "answer": "Total value of $100 bills is 2 × $100 = $<<2*100=200>>200\nTotal value of $50 bills is 5 × $50 = $<<5*50=250>>250\nTotal value of $10 bills is 10 × $10 = $<<10*10=100>>100\nFinal total value is $200 + $250 + $100 = $<<200+250+100=550>>550\n#### 550"
